<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FAMILY GOLF STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FAMILY GOLF STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer said it initiated coverage of Family Golf Centers Inc as an outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Family Golf gained 1/8 to 23-1/8.</p>
</text>
